# This file ensures the data directory is tracked in Git
# while keeping all backup data files ignored for security

# The backup system will create subdirectories here:
# - database/    (database backups)
# - files/       (file system backups)
# - r2-storage/  (R2 cloud storage backups)
# - environment/ (environment configuration backups)

# All actual backup data is ignored by .gitignore for security
